{"slug":"glm-5-3-cyber-capabilities","title":"GLM-5.3 spreads advanced cyber capabilities","narration":"Anthropic says the cyber capability it once restricted to Claude Mythos has already spread. Its new analysis finds Z.ai’s GLM-5.3 can autonomously build sophisticated end-to-end exploits, but ships without comparable misuse safeguards. In Anthropic’s simulated tests, simple bypass techniques defeated GLM-5.3’s protections between 64 and 100 percent of the time. Anthropic says the same attacks failed against its safeguarded Claude models. That does not mean GLM-5.3 is malware; defenders can use the capability too. The uncomfortable shift is that frontier exploit-building is becoming broadly available, so security teams lose the luxury of assuming advanced offensive AI stays gated.","beats":[{"text":"Anthropic says the cyber capability","editorialRole":"setup","visual":{"type":"source","sourceIndex":0,"query":"Anthropic GLM-5.3 cyber capabilities research","mustMatch":["glm-5.3"]},"sfx":"whoosh"},{"text":"it once restricted to Claude Mythos","editorialRole":"fact","visual":{"type":"source","sourceIndex":0,"query":"Claude Mythos restricted cyber capability","mustMatch":["mythos"],"allowReuse":true}},{"text":"has already spread.","editorialRole":"reaction","visual":{"type":"kinetic","text":"THE CAPABILITY SPREAD","emphasis":"SPREAD"},"memeIntent":{"purpose":"reaction","tone":"surprised","intensity":2,"preferredMedia":"image","presentation":"overlay","maxDurationSeconds":0.9,"concepts":["spread","surprised","reaction"]}},{"text":"Its new analysis finds Z.ai’s GLM-5.3","editorialRole":"fact","visual":{"type":"source","sourceIndex":0,"query":"Z.ai GLM-5.3 Anthropic research","mustMatch":["glm-5.3"],"allowReuse":true}},{"text":"can autonomously build sophisticated end-to-end exploits,","editorialRole":"explanation","visual":{"type":"explain","mode":"pipeline","stages":["MODEL","VULN","EXPLOIT"]}},{"text":"but ships without comparable misuse safeguards.","editorialRole":"r